#: scenario8:scenario8_376A60ED_5AF4_4493_BD48_753A76E488D9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca5c3140ae9c63878908f4a31e66d028187095e1ce85a7b4964ea9e92792431e
