msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A1979001_2187_424B_8AF1_F2A6154F5777"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I tried to convince myself it was all a dream—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫some terrible nightmare—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"but I could still feel the warmth of her skin fresh on my hands,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Provai a convincermi che fosse tutto un sogno—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫soltanto un terribile incubo—⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫ma riuscivo a sentire ancora il calore della sua pelle sulle mie mani, ⟪k:5⟫il calore del "
"suo sangue sulle mie dita..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2BF49F46_6AF3_43F9_AB7A_750AB81CA28F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5dc528b7e6e15361cd3e6d6df2eb5855dbfb20ef77dd58a1d16d1f2cf7a6963d
#. default-sha256: b330f84e016921f9ab66f2a6a34623bdee232ecfc0945ab1bf579136a029fdeb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2BF49F46_6AF3_43F9_AB7A_750AB81CA28F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My mind couldn’t keep up with the flood of thoughts and emotions and images. ⟪k:1⟫I wanted "
"to close my eyes, but I was too afraid I would find the bloodbath in the cottage on the back of "
"my eyelids,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La mia mente non riusciva a resistere alla corrente di pensieri e di emozioni. ⟪k:1⟫Volevo "
"chiudere gli occhi, ma avevo troppa paura di richiamare l’immagine di quel bagno di sangue "
"impressa nella mia memoria,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_AFBC8CCF_A298_4ED2_9E04_DE83FDE1BBCB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 029900a777128c70cdb00fb332ba8aeff985b6f4a2f3ee7e73739b5e11267a0c
#. default-sha256: 9dd065a152f24adb92379b786596a2bed3d703639db97c6da7db8b2ec7d85164
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_AFBC8CCF_A298_4ED2_9E04_DE83FDE1BBCB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I didn’t want to admit it was my fault...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I didn’t want to accept that I had "
"caused it..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma non volevo ammettere le mie colpe...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non volevo accettare il fatto di essere "
"stato io a causarlo..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_416CD908_EF6D_4F8D_9FF2_8B9BE9D51255
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
