msgid "⟪k:0⟫By the time I had gotten all the blood off my clothes, the sun was beginning to set."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quando ebbi finito di lavare via il sangue dai miei vestiti,⟪k:1⟫il sole stava iniziando a "
"tramontare."

