"⟪k:0⟫Were... ⟪k:1⟫Were you not able to get my medicine?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Is that what you’re crying "
"about...?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non sei... ⟪k:1⟫Non sei riuscito a prendermi la medicina?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫È⟪k:5⟫ per questo "
"che stai piangendo...?"

